Modifications made by ixPansi in 2026:
  - Android Auto support (browse tree, voice search, queue artwork, ordering)
  - Custom playlist and song covers
  - Recently played on the For You page
  - Rewritten drag-to-reorder
  - Theme presets with matching launcher icons
  - Configurable pause/resume fade; swipe-down-for-lyrics
  - Independent seek-forward and seek-back durations
  - MAZIKA branding, application id and release pipeline

